# Session environment for Hyprland, sourced by uwsm before the compositor starts.
#
# Nothing machine-specific belongs in this file. It is tracked, so any value
# committed here is inherited by every machine that clones the repo — and for
# the one variable that matters, AQ_DRM_DEVICES, an inherited value is worse
# than none: a pin to card paths that do not exist locally makes aquamarine fail
# to create a DRI screen, fall back to kms_swrast, and then die on
# DRM_IOCTL_MODE_CREATE_DUMB.
#
# uwsm sources every file in `env-hyprland.d/` after this one (see `source_dir`
# in /usr/lib/uwsm/prepare-env.sh), so that directory is where this machine's
# values go. It is gitignored, and install.sh writes `env-hyprland.d/10-gpu.sh`
# there when it finds more than one GPU:
#
#     export AQ_DRM_DEVICES="/dev/dri/card1:/dev/dri/card0"
#
# Integrated GPU first, so the desktop does not end up rendering on a discrete
# card. With a single GPU there is nothing to choose between, and no file is
# written at all.
#
# Card numbering is not stable across boots. If the session ever comes up on the
# wrong GPU, re-run install.sh, or edit the drop-in to name a stable path from
# /dev/dri/by-path/.
